   Word HTML has no CSS variables, flexbox, grid or border-radius,
   so tokens are inlined, layout is table-driven, and the rounded
   card radii degrade to square inset panels. Type sizes are the
   documented web ramp scaled to A4 print measure; the ratios,
   weight-400 restraint, tight leading and negative tracking of
   the display faces are preserved.
   ============================================================ */

