<p style="margin:26pt 0 0 0;" class="ml">Business proposal &#183; 30 August 2026</p>

<p class="hero" style="margin:14pt 0 0 0;">ControlPlane</p>
<p style="margin:10pt 0 0 0;font-family:'Unica77 Cohere Web',Inter,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.3pt;color:#17171c;">
 The real-time oversight gateway for enterprise AI</p>

<p class="lead" style="margin:14pt 0 0 0;">Every AI response, inspected before delivery &#8212; quality, cost, and
 responsibility converged into one policy-governed verdict per business pipeline. Working prototype,
 measured evidence, auditable claims.</p>

<p class="rule" style="margin:22pt 0 0 0;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="margin:16pt 0 0 0;font-size:10.5pt;color:#212121;">
 Business Proposal &#8212; Accenture Innovation Challenge 2026, Round 2 (Prototype Development)</p>

